{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/master/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "Slither",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/crytic/slither",
          "version": "0.11.6",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "0-1-reentrancy-eth",
              "name": "reentrancy-eth",
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Reentrancy vulnerabilities"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Apply the [`check-effects-interactions pattern`](http://solidity.readthedocs.io/en/v0.4.21/security-considerations.html#re-entrancy)."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "0-0-suicidal",
              "name": "suicidal",
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Suicidal"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Protect access to all sensitive functions."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "3-0-solc-version",
              "name": "solc-version",
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "0.0"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Incorrect versions of Solidity"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "\nDeploy with a recent version of Solidity (at least 0.8.0) with no known severe issues.\n\nUse a simple pragma version that allows any of these versions.\nConsider using the latest version of Solidity for testing."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "3-0-low-level-calls",
              "name": "low-level-calls",
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "0.0"
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Low-level calls"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Avoid low-level calls. Check the call success. If the call is meant for a contract, check for code existence."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "0-1-reentrancy-eth",
          "message": {
            "text": "Reentrancy in Vault.withdraw() (src/Vault.sol#7-12):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- (ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}() (src/Vault.sol#9)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- balances[msg.sender] = 0 (src/Vault.sol#11)\n\tVault.balances (src/Vault.sol#5) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- Vault.balances (src/Vault.sol#5)\n\t- Vault.deposit() (src/Vault.sol#6)\n\t- Vault.withdraw() (src/Vault.sol#7-12)\n",
            "markdown": "Reentrancy in [Vault.withdraw()](src/Vault.sol#L7-L12):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- [(ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}()](src/Vault.sol#L9)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- [balances[msg.sender] = 0](src/Vault.sol#L11)\n\t[Vault.balances](src/Vault.sol#L5) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- [Vault.balances](src/Vault.sol#L5)\n\t- [Vault.deposit()](src/Vault.sol#L6)\n\t- [Vault.withdraw()](src/Vault.sol#L7-L12)\n"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/Vault.sol"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 7,
                  "endLine": 12
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "id": "ca03621978f842952d7cdc7476b64eb13f2689f4c4c510c2849e84827d42a4b4"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "0-0-suicidal",
          "message": {
            "text": "Vault.kill(address) (src/Vault.sol#13) allows anyone to destruct the contract\n",
            "markdown": "[Vault.kill(address)](src/Vault.sol#L13) allows anyone to destruct the contract\n"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/Vault.sol"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 13
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "id": "62f7f19c9ae3e3b99025fbb22d3a4716a846d16828b5841026e64c915ea6618c"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "3-0-solc-version",
          "message": {
            "text": "Version constraint ^0.8.20 contains known severe issues (https://solidity.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bugs.html)\n\t- VerbatimInvalidDeduplication\n\t- FullInlinerNonExpressionSplitArgumentEvaluationOrder\n\t- MissingSideEffectsOnSelectorAccess.\nIt is used by:\n\t- ^0.8.20 (src/Counter.sol#2)\n\t- ^0.8.20 (src/Vault.sol#2)\n",
            "markdown": "Version constraint ^0.8.20 contains known severe issues (https://solidity.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bugs.html)\n\t- VerbatimInvalidDeduplication\n\t- FullInlinerNonExpressionSplitArgumentEvaluationOrder\n\t- MissingSideEffectsOnSelectorAccess.\nIt is used by:\n\t- [^0.8.20](src/Counter.sol#L2)\n\t- [^0.8.20](src/Vault.sol#L2)\n"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/Counter.sol"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 2,
                  "endLine": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "id": "5af866de9a7b69af56256e6cd0e94c866b9246cd13c42a95487771ac2c5cddbc"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "3-0-low-level-calls",
          "message": {
            "text": "Low level call in Vault.withdraw() (src/Vault.sol#7-12):\n\t- (ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}() (src/Vault.sol#9)\n",
            "markdown": "Low level call in [Vault.withdraw()](src/Vault.sol#L7-L12):\n\t- [(ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}()](src/Vault.sol#L9)\n"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/Vault.sol"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 7,
                  "endLine": 12
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "id": "a42a5771647789bb49b118c4200a7d72e3c8ea3f756383fb4e3b2d9f56e10b95"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}